Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.50,0:00:03.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Sunday evening, and winter's first message
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.11,0:00:05.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,just landed in the family group.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.15,0:00:09.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ba asks: who's making adadiya pak this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.65,0:00:15.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mummy: I'll make it, but who's bringing the ghee?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.96,0:00:16.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,Pappa: me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.84,0:00:20.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ten minutes later, Pappa: how many kilos?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.50,0:00:23.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fai: keep my box aside already.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.79,0:00:26.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,And Jay in America: please courier some!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.80,0:00:30.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Finally, Ba: so who's helping with the stirring?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.75,0:00:32.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the whole group goes quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.70,0:00:36.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who makes adadiya pak at your place?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.36,0:00:39.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tell us in the comments. Follow Otlo.
